SUMMARY:The Pizza and Burger Summer Patio Dinner Party
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 I'd like to invite you out to our **Pizza and Burger Summer Patio Dinner P
 arty!**\n\n-Reserved seating\, friendly people\, good conversation and gre
 at food awaits!\n\n*\\*Joined by my other social groups too so we can anti
 cipate a fabulous turn out!*\n\n**Date:** Sunday\, June 28th\n**Arrival Ti
 me:** Please arrive between 6:00 p.m. -7:00 p.m.\n**Where to Meet us?**\n*
 *Location:** Smoke Show\n**Address:** 747 Mt. Pleasant\n**Free Parking:** 
 in Residential area and on Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton\n**
 Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant Subway:** (Very close\, 1 minute walking distanc
